                "text": "Also starting this year is the Medicare Prescription Payment Plan\u2014a new payment option that can help you manage Rx costs by spreading payments across the calendar year.\n\nAnyone with a Medicare drug plan or Medicare health plan with drug coverage (like a Medicare Advantage Plan with drug coverage) will have the option to use this new plan. This is big news, and I'm so proud to have helped bring these results to Main Street.",
