                "text": "Yesterday, I met with the Coalition of Orange County Community Health Centers here in my Washington, D.C. office. \n\nThey serve nearly 340, 000 patients every year, and they're concerned about the proposed cuts to Medicaid that would impact children and families across every corner of our district. I'll never stop fighting to protect your family's access to affordable health care.",
