                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Are your loved ones at risk of deportation? Are you a vet who was fired from your federal job? Will Medicare cuts hurt your health?\n\nOur best weapon to defend our community is the truth, and it\u2019s my job to take your story to DC. Share it with me here.\ud83d\udc47\nhttps://t.co/RO0OKnFElO",
