                "text": "Meet Dr. Gloria, a Harvard and Claremont grad who's helping shape public health and education across our communities.\n\nShe's also a DACA recipient.\n\nI'll keep pushing for pathways to citizenship so that DACA recipients, like Dr. Gloria, can keep chasing their American Dream. https://t.co/zYvMdptRCF",
