                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last month ICE officers showed up at a Los Angeles Elementary School to conduct a \u201chealth check\u201d  on some elementary school children, without parental authorization.  \u2028\u00a0\u2028None of my colleagues on the other side of the aisle, voted for my amendments.  Sad !!\u2019",
