                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Psychedelic Assisted Therapy Caucus (PATH) looks to bring psychedelic therapies to cure invisible wounds veterans bring back from the battlefield.\u00a0 At yesterday's PATH Caucus meeting, we hosted John Hopkins Medical School Doctors Barrett and Weiss, who presented their psychedelic research findings for treating PTSD.\u00a0To date, the psychedelic therapies promise to revolutionize how we treat mental challenges not only for Vets, but others in our society.  We\u2019ll continue to fight for our vets.",
