                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Big Ugly Bill makes no sense. It would strip families of their health care, seniors from their food, and veterans from the care they need. \n\nI introduced 6 common-sense amendments today to keep schools safe from ICE, protect our veterans, and require ICE agents to show their face and show ID. I encourage my colleagues to put them up for a vote immediately.",
