                "text": "This week, I returned to Washington to vote against the GOP\u2019s One Big, Ugly Bill that would strip away health care hard-earned benefits from hard-working Orange County taxpayers, children, and seniors.\n\nAnd this is just scratching the surface\u2014so I wanted you to know more about what\u2019s in this bill, and how it will impact you and your family.",
